  <item>
    <title>豆瓣酱读书：”爱是人类生存困境的唯一出路“——弗洛姆《爱的艺术》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/664e59b4c59d1e575707d90b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">664e59b4c59d1e575707d90b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 22 May 2024 20:46:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>豆瓣酱读书第一期，邀你共读《爱的艺术》，重新思考所有与爱有关的问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">3:35</a>: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;人们对爱的三个常见的误解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">7:30</a>： ”人最大的焦虑跟恐惧来源于意识到自己是一个跟外界分离的孤独存在“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="748">12:28</a>： 爱的四个要素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="864">14:24</a>： 爱的各种形式以及父母之爱与宗教的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1606">26:46</a>： 资本主义社会让爱变成稀有的个别现象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a>： 爱的实践</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头/片尾曲: </span><strong><span>《Please, Please, Please, Let Me Get What I Want》The Smiths &nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主播/后期：</span><strong><span>MM酱</span></strong></p>]]></description>
