  <item>
    <title>EP1. C酱酱是纽约公立小学的双语老师？她是怎么给小学生上课的？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64d805b980c9ec4c5f189024</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64d805b980c9ec4c5f189024</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 12 Aug 2023 22:20:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoizYbZA4Kq9q-4OJt3QKq6vQc1F.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>图片是C酱酱的教室跟她的孩子们。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timestamp：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 双语班还分bilingual program 跟dual language program?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="425">07:05</a> 美国一年级小学生也要从“英文的拼音”phonics 学起？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">09:15</a> 小学一年级就要上“情商课”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a> 数学课上数假硬币？1美分，五美分，十美分，二十五美分傻傻分不清楚？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 怎么教单词都认不清楚的小朋友写作？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 孔子的因材施教叫differentiation?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> 美国公立小学食堂的伙食全世界最差？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2034">33:54</a> 全校所有年段轮流共用一个食堂。幼儿园小朋友早上九点就开始吃午饭？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 用手电筒与硬纸板带领小朋友认识光与声的世界。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2920">48:40</a> “请不要问我你孩子的成绩跟班上其他同学比怎么样，Ta 跟上次比进步了好多，真是太棒了！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> 如果学生考砸了，老师要回去反省教学方式？</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目中提到的一些terms：</span></p><span></span><p><span>ESL/ENL: English as a second language/English as a new language 英语作为第二语言/英语作为一门新语言</span></p><span></span><p><span>Transitional bilingual education: 过渡性双语教育</span></p><span></span><p><span>phonics:自然拼读法</span></p><span></span><p><span>social emotional learning: 社会情感学习</span></p><span></span><p><span>informational writing: 信息写作</span></p><span></span><p><span>shadow puppet: 皮影戏</span></p><span></span><p><span>lasagna: 意大利千层面</span></p><span></span><p><span>chicken tenders：鸡柳</span></p><span></span><p><span>burrito：墨西哥卷</span></p><span></span><p><span>allergy：过敏</span></p><span></span><p><span>aluminum foil：锡纸</span></p><span></span><p><span>manipulatives：数学玩具/道具</span></p><span></span><p><span>hands-on activities：亲自动手的活动</span></p><span></span><p><span>literacy center：根据学生的学习程度分类提供能提高学习技能的一些帮助的活动小组</span></p><span></span><p><span>guided reading：由一个老师对6个或以下的学生进行指导阅读</span></p><span></span><p><span>differentiation：差异化教学/因材施教</span></p>]]></description>
